data.description:
A new dumb adventure awaits with Dumb Ways: Free For All! Available on the Quest 2, Quest 3 and 3s, play solo or bring up to FIVE other players along to experience the dumb mayhem together. Embark on a ‘mostly-safe’ vacation where each destination brings wild activities and unexpected surprises - all in the form of crazy, fun-filled minigames! 

# FREE FOR ALL MADNESS 
Multiplayer adds a new challenge to the game, as you compete head-to-head for the highest score! Watch out for your fellow travelers who are trying to sabotage your holiday, they will stop at nothing to throw you off your game, ruin your holiday and your winning streak.

{1215360069887079}

# SO MANY DUMB MINIGAMES
Your epic journey across the globe will be filled with a whopping 75 unique minigames across three incredible destinations: Bumbling Bay, Jumble Jungle and Freezerville. Feed monkeys, save freezing Beans and fend off hungry piranhas during your holiday escapades to get the highest score! 

{496519749671416}

# CHAOTIC WEATHER 
Bad weather can ruin an otherwise perfect holiday, or in this case your top score. At the end of each minigame playlist, or “Tours”, brace yourself for an extra surge of adrenaline as the difficulty is ramped up as you face extreme weather events.

{1055345746177976}

# MORE PLACES TO TRAVEL SOON
One more FREE DLC update is on its way! On January 23rd, you will be able to travel to Beanulon Prime. Adding an extra 25 minigames to keep the free for all fun rolling and bringing the total of minigames to 100!

{1166717894630635}
